-- Stage 2 Mathematics two-year program: 320 coming-soon placeholder lessons.
-- Year 3 and Year 4, 40 weeks each, 4 lessons a week (concept, strategies, problem solving, fluency and review).
-- Ten four-week units a year. Placeholders are shared lessons (family_id NULL) flagged coming_soon.
-- Build a lesson by replacing its row's data and removing coming_soon (keep the seed_key or add a topic suffix).
WITH u(y, n, wf, wt, unit, strand) AS (VALUES
